<title>USA: Harmony Township BOE, N.J., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Harmony Township BOE, N.J., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities, Inc said it won $3.014 million of Harmony Township Board of Education, N.J., school bonds, Series 1996, with the lowest raate of 5.25, highest price of 100.0373.</p>
</text>
